# Debug

Gather the symptom, relevant logs and reproduction steps. Trace the code, form falsifiable hypotheses and distinguish observed evidence from inference. Identify the root cause and the smallest viable remedy. If fixing is authorized, implement it and add a regression test. If asked only to diagnose, do not change code.

Examples: investigate a failed build without editing; reproduce and fix a reported parsing bug. If reproduction is unavailable, clearly report the limits and ask for targeted evidence.
